step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Begin the quest by talking to <col=800000>Chancellor Hassan</col>, who is in the southern room on the uk=0 of <col=800000>Al Kharid palace</col>. Grab the jug of water off the table in the eastern room if you did not bring your own.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Begin the quest by talking to Chancellor Hassan, who is in the southern room on the uk=0 of Al Kharid palace. Grab the jug of water off the table in the eastern room if you did not bring your own.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Osman</col> just north of the palace.</col>
